---
title: Nightly backup
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer
    participant Agent as Backup agent
    participant Disk
    participant Cloud as Cloud storage
    Timer->>+Agent: Start at 02:00
    loop Every volume
        Agent->>Disk: Take a snapshot
        Disk-->>Agent: Snapshot ready
        rect rgb(225, 240, 255)
            Agent->>Cloud: Upload the changed blocks
            Cloud-->>Agent: Stored
        end
    end
    alt All volumes stored
        Agent->>Cloud: Write the catalog
    else An upload failed
        Agent->>Timer: Retry in an hour
    end
    opt The disk is nearly full
        Agent->>Disk: Delete the oldest snapshots
    end
    par Report
        Agent-)Timer: Summary
    and Clean up
        Agent->>Disk: Release the snapshots
    end
    Note over Agent,Disk: Snapshots are kept for 7 days
    deactivate Agent
